# quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720 — «Sylph Says» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: シルフの仮宿のラキシオは、冒険者をまだ認めていないようだ。
#. de: Laxio ist noch immer nicht von deinen guten Absichten überzeugt.
#. fr: Laxio n'est pas encore ami avec vous...
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Laxio of Little Solace remains unconvinced of your intentions."
msgstr "Лаксио из Малого Утешения всё ещё не верит в ваши добрые намерения."

#. ja: ラキシオのご機嫌をとるため、エモート「つつく」をしよう。
#. de: Laxio verlangt, dass du jeden ihrer Befehle befolgst, um zu beweisen, dass du wirklich <if $gn4>eine Freundin<else>ein Freund</if> der Sylphen bist. Zunächst sollst du ihren Rücken anstupsen (/stups), da es sie dort juckt.
#. fr: Pour faire plaisir à Laxio, <i>touchez-le</i> légèrement du doigt.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Laxio demands that you obey his every command as proof that you are a friend to the sylphs. First, /poke his back to scratch an itch."
msgstr "Лаксио требует выполнять все его приказания, чтобы доказать, что вы друг сильфов. Для начала почешите ему спину эмоцией «Тыкнуть» (/poke)."

#. ja: 魔法をかけられてしまったらしい、エモート「自分を見る」をしよう。
#. de: Bei der Berührung Laxios wurdest du von einem Sylphenfluch befallen, der deine Haut in Moos verwandelt. Betrachte dich /selbst, um dich von dem Effekt zu überzeugen.
#. fr: Laxio vous a jeté un sort<nbsp>! <i>Regardez-vous</i> pour voir à quoi vous ressemblez maintenant.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "By touching Laxio, you have been afflicted with a sylphic curse that turns one's skin to moss. /examineself and ascertain its dire effect."
msgstr "Прикоснувшись к Лаксио, вы попали под действие сильфийского проклятия, от которого кожа покрывается мхом. Используйте эмоцию «Осмотреть себя» (/examineself), чтобы увидеть, что с вами стало."

#. ja: ラキシオのご機嫌をとるため、エモート「称賛する」をしよう。
#. de: Der Fluch war eine Lüge - Laxio hat dich reingelegt. Gratuliere ihr zu diesem /super Streich.
#. fr: Pour flatter Laxio, <i>félicitez-le</i>.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "The curse was a lie; Laxio was only fooling you. Express your adulation and /congratulate him on his brilliant ruse."
msgstr "Проклятие оказалось выдумкой — Лаксио вас разыграл. Похвалите его за блестящую проделку эмоцией «Поздравить» (/congratulate)."

#. ja: ラキシオはご機嫌だ。冒険者はラキシオにもやっと認められたようだ。
#. de: Dein Sinn für Humor freut Laxio, die dich nun mit offenen Flügeln in der Sylphen-Zuflucht willkommen heißt.
#. fr: Laxio semble ravi de votre petit entretien. Vous avez un ami de plus.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_SEQ_04:1"
msgid "Your sense of humor pleases Laxio, who now welcomes you to Little Solace with wings outspread."
msgstr "Лаксио оценил ваше чувство юмора и теперь с распростёртыми крыльями приветствует вас в Малом Утешении."

#. ja: ラキシオに「つつく」をする
#. de: Laxio anstupsen (/stups)
#. fr: Essayer de <i>/toucher</i> Laxio du doigt
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_TODO_00:1"
msgid "/poke Laxio."
msgstr "Используйте эмоцию «Тыкнуть» на Лаксио."

#. ja: ラキシオをターゲットして「自分を見る」をする
#. de: Laxio zeigen, wie du dich /selbst betrachtest
#. fr: Cibler Laxio et <i>/seregarder</i>
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_TODO_01:1"
msgid "/examineself before Laxio."
msgstr "Используйте эмоцию «Осмотреть себя», выбрав Лаксио целью."

#. ja: ラキシオに「称賛する」をする
#. de: Laxios Streich /super finden
#. fr: Cibler Laxio et le <i>/féliciter</i>
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_TODO_02:1"
msgid "/congratulate Laxio."
msgstr "Используйте эмоцию «Поздравить» на Лаксио."

#. ja: うちらに挨拶して回ってるのはお前ふっち？<br>けっこう踊りが上手だけど、それくらいじゃ<br>アタピは仲良くしてあげないふっち。
#. de: <if $gn4>Die Laufende<else>Der Laufende</if> tanzt viele Tänze, aber die Meinige mag Laufende noch immer nicht! Warum? Weil Laufende nie zuhören! Darum!
#. fr: C'est vous qui dansez un peu partout, dont j'ai entendu parler<nbsp>?<br>Vous dansez bien, mais ça ne suffit pas à me toucher<nbsp>!<br>Vous essayez de vous faire des amis, j'ai cru deviner<nbsp>?
#. speaker: LAXIO
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_000:1"
msgid "Walking one may dance many dances, but this one still doesn't like walking ones! Why? Because walking ones don't listen! That's why!"
msgstr "Ходячий может танцевать сколько угодно, а эта всё равно не любит ходячих! Почему? Потому что ходячие не слушают! Вот почему!"

#. ja: 仲良くちたいなら、アタピの言うこときくふっち！<br>まずは背中がかゆいから掻いてほしいでふっち。<br>ちょっと「つつく」くらいで丁度いいふっち。
#. de: Wenn <if $gn4>die Laufende<else>der Laufende</if> <if $gn4>eine Freundin<else>ein Freund</if> der Meinigen sein möchte, sollte <if $gn4>die Laufende<else>der Laufende</if> zuhören, und zwar gut zuhören! Die Meinige juckt es am Rücken. <if $gn4>Die Laufende<else>Der Laufende</if> sollte sie dort mal anstupsen.
#. fr: Faites tout ce que je vous dis, si vous voulez qu'on le soit<nbsp>!<br>D'abord, mon dos me gratte, alors si vous pouviez le <i>toucher</i> du doigt...
#. speaker: LAXIO
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_001:1"
msgid "If walking one wants to be friend to this one, walking one should listen, and listen good! This one has itchy spot on back. Walking one should <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poke</ui-edge-color></ui-color> it."
msgstr "Если ходячий хочет дружить с этой, ему надо слушаться! У этой спина чешется. Ходячему стоит её <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>потыкать</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: 早く背中を「つつく」ふっち。<br>優しくちないと怒るでふっち。
#. de: Die Meinige juckt es am Rücken. <if $gn4>Die Laufende<else>Der Laufende</if> sollte mich mal anstupsen. Aber nicht zu hart! Die Meinige hat empfindliche Haut.
#. fr: Grattez-moi le dos avec <i>toucher</i>, et vite<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_010:1"
msgid "This one has itchy spot on back. Walking one should <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poke</ui-edge-color></ui-color> it. And not too hard! This one has sensitive fibers."
msgstr "У этой спина чешется. Ходячему надо <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>потыкать</ui-edge-color></ui-color> её. Только не сильно! У этой нежные волокна."

#. ja: ひっかかったでふっち！<br>アタピに触ったお前には、<br>姿が緑になる魔法をかけたふっち！
#. de: Hihi! <if $gn4>Die Laufende<else>Der Laufende</if> ist in die Falle getappt! Die Meinige zu berühren verwandelt die Haut <if $gn4>der Laufenden<else>des Laufenden</if> in Moos!
#. fr: Bien joué<nbsp>! Pour la peine, je vais vous transformer<nbsp>!<br>Vous allez devenir tout<if $gn4>e</if> vert<if $gn4>e</if> comme un fourré<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_015:1"
msgid "Tee hee! Walking one fell into trap! Touching this one turns walking ones' skin into moss!"
msgstr "Хи-хи! Ходячий попался в ловушку! Стоило прикоснуться к этой, как кожа ходячего покрылась мхом!"

#. ja: よーく「自分を見る」でふっち。<br>緑のマヌケな姿になってるでふっち。
#. de: Hihi! Die Haut <if $gn4>der Moosigen<else>des Moosigen</if> wird immer grüner! <if $gn4>Die Moosige<else>Der Moosige</if> sollte sich mal selbst betrachten, um zu sehen, wie lustig das ausschaut!
#. fr: Maintenant, <i>regardez-vous</i><nbsp>!<br>Admirez comme vous avez l'air foufou<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_016:1"
msgid "Tee hee! Mossy one's skin turns greener and greener! Mossy one should <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>examine self</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to see how silly mossy one has become!"
msgstr "Хи-хи! У мшистого кожа всё зеленее и зеленее! Мшистому надо <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>осмотреть себя</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, чтобы увидеть, каким глупышом он стал!"

#. ja: そうじゃないふっち！<br>ちゃんと「つつく」のでふっち。
#. de: Hat <if $gn4>die Laufende<else>der Laufende</if> etwas an den Ohren? Die Meinige hat gesagt, <if $gn4>die Laufende<else>der Laufende</if> soll den Rücken der Meinigen kratzen!
#. fr: Pas comme ça<nbsp>! Il faut me <i>toucher</i><nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_020:1"
msgid "Do walking one's ears not hear? This one said walking one should <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>poke</ui-edge-color></ui-color> this one's back!"
msgstr "У ходячего что, уши не слышат? Эта же сказала <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>потыкать</ui-edge-color></ui-color> ей в спину!"

#. ja: 緑の魔法は、よくきいてるでふっち。<br>よく「自分を見る」でふっち。
#. de: Hihi! Die Haut <if $gn4>der Moosigen<else>des Moosigen</if> wird immer grüner! <if $gn4>Die Moosige<else>Der Moosige</if> sollte sich mal selbst betrachten!
#. fr: Mon sort a vraiment bien marché<nbsp>!<br>Admirez le résultat avec <i>se regarder</i><nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_030:1"
msgid "Tee hee! Mossy one's skin turns greener and greener! Mossy one should <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>examine self</ui-edge-color></ui-color>!"
msgstr "Хи-хи! Кожа мшистого всё зеленее и зеленее! Мшистому надо <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>осмотреть себя</ui-edge-color></ui-color>!"

#. ja: あははは、騙されたふっち。<br>緑の魔法はウソふっち！
#. de: Hihihi! <if $gn4>Die Laufende<else>Der Laufende</if> ist so ein Dummerchen! Es gibt keinen Fluch, Dummerchen!
#. fr: Hi hi hi, c'était une blague, je rigolais<nbsp>!<br>En fait, je ne vous ai rien fait<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_035:1"
msgid "Hee hee hee! Walking one is so silly! There is no curse, silly one!"
msgstr "Хи-хи-хи! Ходячий такой глупыш! Нет никакого проклятия, глупыш!"

#. ja: アタピは、かなりウソがうまいでふっち？<br>「称賛する」といいふっちよ。
#. de: Die Meinige hat Dummerchen super reingelegt, oder? Die Meinige ist so schlau. Dummerchen sollte der Meinigen sagen, wie schlau sie ist.
#. fr: Je vous ai bien eu<if $gn4>e</if>, j'ai bien ri<nbsp>!<br>Vous devriez me <i>féliciter</i> pour ma drôlerie<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_036:1"
msgid "This one tricked silly one good, yes? This one is smart. Silly one should <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>congratulate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> this one for being so very smart."
msgstr "Эта здорово разыграла глупыша, да? Эта такая умная. Глупышу надо <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>поздравить</ui-edge-color></ui-color> эту за такую сообразительность."

#. ja: あはははは、そんなことしてもダメふっち。<br>それじゃ「自分を見る」ことは、できないふっち。
#. de: Ist das Gehirn <if $gn4>der Laufenden<else>des Laufenden</if> auch vermoost? Die Meinige hat gesagt, <if $gn4>die Moosige<else>der Moosige</if> sollte sich mal selbst betrachten! Also los!
#. fr: Vous en faites une tête<nbsp>! <i>Regardez-vous</i><nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_040:1"
msgid "Does walking one's brain turn to moss, too? This one said mossy one should <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>examine self</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. What is mossy one waiting for?"
msgstr "У ходячего мозги тоже мхом поросли? Эта сказала мшистому <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>осмотреть себя</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Чего мшистый ждёт?"

#. ja: すごいでふっち？<br>アタピを「称賛する」でふっち。
#. de: Die Meinige ist schlau. Dummerchen sollte der Meinigen sagen, wie schlau die Meinige ist.
#. fr: Im<shy>pres<shy>sionnant, pas vrai<nbsp>?<br><i>Félicitez-moi</i> pour ce bon tour que j'ai fait<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_050:1"
msgid "This one is smart. Silly one should <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>congratulate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> this one for being so very smart."
msgstr "Эта такая умная. Глупышу надо <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>поздравить</ui-edge-color></ui-color> эту за такую сообразительность."

#. ja: そうでふっち。<br>アタピはすごいのでふっち。
#. de: So ist es, Dummerchen! Die Meinige ist eine sehr, sehr Schlaue. Dummerchen sollte sich das merken.
#. fr: Bien, bien<nbsp>! J'ai vraiment un sens de l'humour unique<nbsp>!<br>On ne dirait pas, avec mon air angélique<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_055:1"
msgid "That's right, silly one! This one is very, very smart one. Silly one is smart to know this."
msgstr "Вот именно, глупыш! Эта очень-очень умная. И глупыш тоже умный, раз это понял."

#. ja: お前はおもちろいのでふっち。<br>しょうがないから仲良くちてやるでふっち！
#. de: Dummerchen macht die Meinige lachen. Die Meinige lacht gerne. Vielleicht ist Dummerchen gar nicht so übel.
#. fr: Grâce à vous, j'ai bien ri<nbsp>!<br>À partir d'aujourd'hui, nous serons amis<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_056:1"
msgid "Silly one makes this one laugh. This one likes to laugh. Maybe silly one is not so bad, after all."
msgstr "Глупыш смешит эту. Эта любит смеяться. Может, глупыш не так уж плох."

#. ja: そんなのおもちろくないふっち！<br>アタピを「称賛する」のでふっち。
#. de: Dummerchen ist langweilig! Die Meinige hat Dummerchen reingelegt. Dummerchen sollte der Meinigen sagen, wie schlau die Meinige ist!
#. fr: Mais non<nbsp>! Il faut me <i>féliciter</i>, voyons<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LAXIO
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa106_00720:TEXT_GAIUSA106_00720_LAXIO_000_060:1"
msgid "Silly one is no fun! This one tricked silly one. Silly one should <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>congratulate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> this one for being so very smart."
msgstr "Глупыш совсем не забавный! Эта его разыграла. Глупышу надо <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>поздравить</ui-edge-color></ui-color> эту за такую сообразительность."
